UC-PRC-02
Title:
View order summary
Description:
When the order reaches a final state (Delivered | Rejected | Cancelled), PRC adds one ledger entry with that state, the order's timestamps and its total charge:
if delivered → total billing amount
if cancelled or rejected → 0$

Note that the total order fare is never recomputed, so an order's total cannot change.
